DESCRIPTION:To cancel or reschedule\, use this link: https://you.ashbyhq.
 com/meeting/b61bb226-860f-4ebe-9d8c-70816b607c43/ <p>Hi <span>Hannes</sp
 an>\,</p><p></p><p>You’re confirmed for your interview for the <span>Sen
 ior Software Engineer </span> role at Legora. Below are the details to h
 elp you prepare and feel ready:</p><p></p><p><strong>Details</strong></p
 ><ul><li><p><strong>Date:</strong> <span>Tue\, Apr 28\, 2026</span></p><
 /li><li><p><strong>Time:</strong> <span>1:00 PM Europe/Berlin</span></p>
 </li><li><p><strong>Location:</strong> <span>N/A</span></p></li><li><p><
 strong>Interviewers:</strong> <span>Roza Kawa</span> -  <span>People Ena
 blement Partner</span></p><p></p></li></ul><p>If anything changes or you
  have questions\, simply reply to the confirmation email and I'll be gla
 d to assist.</p><p></p><p>Looking forward to speaking with you!</p><p></
 p><p>Warm wishes\,</p><p></p><p><span>Roza</span></p><p><span>People Ena
 blement Partner</span></p><p></p><br /><p>To keep your interview experie
 nce seamless and distraction-free\, we use an AI Notetaker to record and
  transcribe our interviews. This helps interviewers focus fully on the c
 onversation and ensures your responses are captured accurately. The reco
 rding will only be used internally for evaluation. If you would prefer n
 ot to be recorded\, you can opt out using the link below. Opting out wil
 l not impact your candidacy in any way.</p><p><a target="_blank" rel="no
 opener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://you.ashbyhq.com/consent/e42f15
 4a-b2c0-4bae-b342-7be49bf2c0dc">Click here to opt-out</a></p>\n\n-::~:~:
